{"seq":3,"slug":"oral-history","title":"口述历史","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history","introMarkdown":"# 口述历史 简介\n\n口述历史通过系统收集和分析个体的口头叙述来重建历史经验，尤其关注那些在文字档案中被忽略或边缘化的声音。作为一种独特的研究方法，口述历史将记忆本身视为有价值的历史证据，同时也将研究者与讲述者的互动关系纳入方法论反思。\n\n本课程设置四个章节，从理论到实践完整展现口述历史的学术面貌。第一章**口述历史理论**奠定学科的认识论基础，探讨记忆与证词的关系、口述历史中的主观性问题以及口头传统与书写历史的区别与联系，帮助学习者理解口述资料的独特认识论地位。第二章**口述历史方法**聚焦田野操作的核心技能，涵盖访谈技术的设计与实施、录制与转录的技术规范以及口述历史研究中的伦理考量，为独立开展口述历史项目提供方法论指南。第三章**口述资料分析**深入探讨叙事分析、互证与交叉验证以及集体记忆三个维度的分析方法，展示如何从口述材料中提取可靠的历史信息和深层意义。第四章**口述历史实践**将理论和方法落地为具体的项目形态，介绍社区口述历史、数字口述历史档案和口述历史与教育三个实践方向。\n\n建议学习者在学习过程中策划并实施一个小型口述历史项目，在实践中整合所学的理论、方法和分析技能。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"口述历史理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"memory-and-testimony","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 记忆与证词","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/foundations/memory-and-testimony"},{"seq":2,"slug":"subjectivity-in-oral-history","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 口述历史中的主观性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/foundations/subjectivity-in-oral-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"oral-tradition-vs-history","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 口头传统与历史","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/foundations/oral-tradition-vs-history"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"methodology","title":"口述历史方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interview-techniques","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 访谈技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/methodology/interview-techniques"},{"seq":2,"slug":"recording-transcription","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 录制与转录","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/methodology/recording-transcription"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ethical-considerations","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 伦理考量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/methodology/ethical-considerations"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"analysis","title":"口述资料分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"narrative-analysis-oral","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 叙事分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/analysis/narrative-analysis-oral"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-referencing-sources","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 互证与交叉验证","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/analysis/cross-referencing-sources"},{"seq":3,"slug":"collective-memory","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 集体记忆","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/analysis/collective-memory"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"projects","title":"口述历史实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/projects","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"community-oral-history","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 社区口述历史","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/projects/community-oral-history"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-oral-archives","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 数字口述历史档案","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/projects/digital-oral-archives"},{"seq":3,"slug":"oral-history-and-education","title":"研究生 口述历史 — 口述历史与教育","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/history/oral-history/projects/oral-history-and-education"}]}]}